title: A helper tool for every researcher
description: Why P1 offers a small, optional tool for interactive GPU sessions, so every researcher gets the same safe way in.
authors: [Benjamin Starostka Jakobsen]
created: 2026-11-14
updated: 2026-11-19
status: open
